sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / KFP Pipeline
    participant Exp as AI4RAGExperiment
    participant HPO as GAM Optimizer
    participant SS as Search Space
    participant Chunker as Chunker<br/>(LangChain / Docling)
    participant OGXEmb as OGX Embeddings API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OGXVec as OGX Vector IO API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OGXChat as OGX Chat API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB<br/>(in-memory)
    participant Eval as Unitxt Evaluator
    participant LLMaJ as LLM-as-a-Judge
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: RAG Optimization Experiment
        User->>Exp: Configure experiment<br/>(search space, benchmark data)
        Exp->>SS: Prepare search space
        SS->>OGXChat: GET /models (discover models)<br/>Auth: API Key
        OGXChat-->>SS: Available models list
        SS->>OGXEmb: GET /models (discover embeddings)<br/>Auth: API Key
        OGXEmb-->>SS: Available embedding models
        SS-->>Exp: Validated search space

        loop For each HPO iteration
            Exp->>HPO: Request next configuration
            HPO-->>Exp: Selected RAG config<br/>(model, embedder, chunker, params)

            Exp->>Chunker: Chunk documents<br/>(token-based or structure-aware)
            Chunker-->>Exp: Document chunks with IDs (SHA-256)

            Exp->>OGXEmb: POST /embeddings<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer)
            OGXEmb-->>Exp: Embedding vectors

            Exp->>OGXVec: POST /vector_io/insert<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer)
            OGXVec-->>Exp: Indexed chunks

            Exp->>OGXVec: POST /vector_io/query<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer)
            OGXVec-->>Exp: Retrieved context chunks

            Exp->>OGXChat: POST /chat/completions<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer)
            OGXChat-->>Exp: Generated answer

            Exp->>Eval: Evaluate (in-process)<br/>correctness, faithfulness, context
            Eval-->>Exp: Unitxt metric scores

            opt LLM-as-a-Judge enabled
                Exp->>LLMaJ: Evaluate answer relevance
                LLMaJ->>OGXChat: POST /chat/completions<br/>(judge model)
                OGXChat-->>LLMaJ: Judge response (JSON)
                LLMaJ-->>Exp: Relevance score
            end

            Exp->>HPO: Report scores<br/>(update GAM model)
        end

        Exp-->>User: Best RAG pattern<br/>(config JSON, notebooks)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 2: KFP Document Discovery & Indexing
        User->>S3: list_objects_v2<br/>Auth: AWS IAM (access key)
        S3-->>User: Object listing<br/>(with size-based sampling)

        User->>Chunker: Extract text (Docling)<br/>(PDF, DOCX, PPTX)
        Chunker-->>User: Parsed documents

        User->>Chunker: Chunk documents
        Chunker-->>User: Document chunks

        User->>OGXEmb: POST /embeddings<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer)
        OGXEmb-->>User: Embedding vectors

        User->>OGXVec: POST /vector_io/insert<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer)
        OGXVec-->>User: Indexed in vector store
    end
